<section id="how" class="sec wrap" data-section="how">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <span class="pill">How it works</span>
    <h2 class="h2">Three steps, and the first is <span class="serif">what you do anyway.</span></h2>
  </div>
  <div class="steps3">
    <div class="card stack" style="gap:16px"><span class="num">1</span><h3 class="h3">Take a screenshot</h3><p class="muted">Use <kbd class="key">⇧</kbd> <kbd class="key">⌘</kbd> <kbd class="key">4</kbd> or any tool you like. Shotlight watches the folder you pick.</p></div>
    <div class="card stack" style="gap:16px"><span class="num">2</span><h3 class="h3">It gets a clear name</h3><p class="muted">A pill shows the new name for a couple of seconds, with Edit and Undo. Nothing else interrupts you.</p></div>
    <div class="card stack" style="gap:16px"><span class="num">3</span><h3 class="h3">Press ⌥Space to find it</h3><p class="muted">Type a few words you remember. Open it, preview it, rename it again or drag it into another app.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>
